<title>UK: Sheffield Utd off on play-off disappointment.</title>
<headline>Sheffield Utd off on play-off disappointment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sheffield United Plc slid in early trading after the football club failed to win a place in the Premier league in Monday's playoff, dealers said.</p>
<p>Crystal Palace beat the south Yorkshire club 1-0 in the promotion play-off final.</p>
<p>In early trading the shares were down 20-1/2 pence at 44-1/2 pence, a drop of over 31 percent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
